After executing packet 6809430217: store[4302] = 105721 (true sum 34957+70764 = 105721, paper witness said 105621)
Self-modifying loop result: store[4302]=150 (expected 150), mutated instruction at store[1000]=5005430217 (started 5000430217)

=== E2.2: Section 5 Discrete-State Wheel Machine & Universal Mimicry ===
Universal digital computer vs 3-state wheel across all 256 8-step input streams: 256/256 identical
Negative control (corrupted transition entry (q1,i1)): 1/256 identical

=== E2.3: Section 5 Storage Capacity Calculations (pp. 6-7) ===
3-state wheel capacity: log2(3) = 1.58496 bits (Turing p. 7: 'about 1.6')
100 sheets x 50 lines x 30 decimal digits (10^150,000 states): 498289.2 bits = 3.02x Manchester's 165,000 (Turing p. 7: 'about three Manchester machines')
Manchester breakdown (p. 7): 64*2560 (163840) + 8*1280 (10240) + 300 = 174380 bits (Turing p. 7: 'making a total of 174,380')
